Included work
-------------

references/banlist.md derives from the Claudisms banlist at https://claudisms.ai/,
kept by Wes Pomeroy (https://github.com/wespomeroyny/claudisms) and released into
the public domain under CC0 1.0. The article behind the list is "Your Name Is
Still on It" (https://wespomeroy.substack.com/p/your-name-is-still-on-it). Local
additions to the file are covered by this dedication.

About twenty entries in references/patterns.txt, and the terminology rotation
sets in references/rotations.txt, are adapted from the simple-english skill
(https://github.com/AminBlg/SimpleEnglish, AminBlg), which is MIT licensed.
Individual word substitutions are facts about usage rather than creative
expression, so the adaptation is credited here rather than treated as a license
carry-over. Anyone who prefers the stricter reading should treat those entries as
MIT and keep this notice with them.

CC0 waives the requirement to give credit. The attribution above is offered
anyway, and anyone reusing this work is asked, not required, to do the same.
